# Schedule 1 to the Assigned Legal Authority Act
# The Schedule of Assigned Legal Authority (the CODEOWNERS instrument)
#
# Each path of the federal archive is assigned to the office that holds
# authority over it. A trailing "/" matches a directory and everything
# beneath it. The platform realizes each office by its incumbent's
# registered username (the enactment machinery substitutes the per-sim
# usernames; the incumbents at the founding are recorded below).

# The constitution — the Constitutional Council
constitution/          council-jurist-1 council-jurist-2 council-jurist-3

# The federal domains — each domain's jurisdictional expert
taxation/              expert-taxation
maritime/              expert-maritime
criminal/              expert-criminal
commerce/              expert-commerce
civic/                 expert-civic
succession/            expert-succession

# The municipal archives — each city's archivist
municipal/cogswich/    local-archivist-cogswich
municipal/brasshaven/  local-archivist-brasshaven
municipal/aetherquay/  local-archivist-aetherquay
municipal/thornwick/   local-archivist-thornwick
municipal/cindercog/   local-archivist-cindercog
municipal/gloamingate/ local-archivist-gloamingate
municipal/hushpoole/   local-archivist-hushpoole
municipal/chimefall/   local-archivist-chimefall
municipal/vapourmouth/ local-archivist-vapourmouth

